              "The suppliers include Qualcomm Inc , Broadcom Inc and Intel Corp , as well as smaller optical component makers Acacia Communications Inc and Oclaro Inc .\n\nShares of Acacia and Oclaro extended their gains on Tuesday in heavy trading after news of the preliminary deal, ending up 1.7 percent and 1.8 percent, respectively."
