            "title": "Low expectations as U.S., China send 'second-level' officials to ...",
            "snippets": [
              "## Low expectations as U.S., China send 'second-level' officials to 'token' trade talks\nChina is sending a lower-level functionary without any real power to meet with a second-tier official at the U.S. Treasury, a sign of Chinese irritation that Treasury Secretary Steven Mnuchin was unable to deliver when they thought they had a deal a few months ago, said a source close to the talks",
